                    Phrase(english: "Autumn leaves are red", translation: "紅葉が赤いです (Momiji ga akai desu)", romanization: nil, exampleEnglish: "In Kyoto, autumn leaves are beautiful and red.", exampleTranslation: "京都では紅葉が赤くて綺麗です。"),
